  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA Census 2014 - CENSUS - UNFPA 2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNFPA Folkr&#xe4;kning 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folkr&#xe4;kning planeras till 1 april 2014. Gemensam fond med flertal     givare via UNFPA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Population census planned for 1 April 2014. Pool fund with several    donors channeled through UNFPA.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Population Census 2014 has produced accurate, reliable data on the demographic and socio-economic characteristics and have produced all thematic reports etc that it set out to do.
This, the last year of the Census process has been used to mainly further disseminate data and to make data widely available for both the public as well as professionals.</narrative>
  </description>
